# ── Local development ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite database, zero configuration. `npm run db:setup` creates and seeds it.
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

# ── Production (Vercel) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vercel Postgres automatically exposes POSTGRES_PRISMA_URL when you connect a
# database to this project — no extra configuration needed. The server also
# understands plain DATABASE_URL values that start with postgres://.

# ── Optional: Stripe test mode ─────────────────────────────────────
# Without a key, checkout uses the built-in test payment provider
# (card 4242 always approves). With STRIPE_SECRET_KEY set (sk_test_…),
# the Stripe adapter is used instead.
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=""
